  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd plain-English labels and descriptive hover tooltips to all 13 icon controls in the main viewport bottom bar (#2914):\n- Add `label(kind: Nav) -> &'static str` for consistent accessible button names: `Frame all`, `Isometric view`, `Display mode`, `Display menu`, `Show all toolpaths`, `World axes`, `Pick through`, `Move mode`, `Rotate mode`, `Projection`, `Orbit tool`, `Pan tool`, `Zoom tool`.\n- Add `tooltip(kind: Nav, state: &State) -> String` to show concise descriptions that reflect dynamic toggle states (wireframe on/off, display menu open/closed, toolpaths on/off, world axes on/off, pick-through on/off, move handles on/off, rotate rings on/off, perspective/orthographic projection, and active nav drag latch).\n- Extract label and tooltip logic to sibling file `crates/ui/src/egui_app/viewport_bar_text.rs` (174 lines) and tests to `crates/ui/src/egui_app/viewport_bar_tooltip_tests.rs` (320 lines) to keep all files well under the 400-line project guideline (`viewport_bar.rs` is 277 lines, `viewport_bar_tests.rs` is 202 lines).\n- Attach `ui.interact` with `Sense::hover()`, `widget_info`, and `on_hover_text(tip)` inside `viewport_bar::draw`, suppressed while a viewport drag is active.\n\n## UI Evidence\n\n### At Rest (No Hover)\n![At rest baseline](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/00_at_rest.png)\n\n### Standard View Controls\n| Control | Tooltip Preview |\n|---|---|\n| **Frame all** | ![Frame all](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/01_frame_all.png) |\n| **Isometric view** | ![Isometric view](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/02_iso_view.png) |\n\n### State Toggles (Off vs On / Modes)\n| Control | State: Off / Alternate | State: On / Active |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Display mode** | ![Wireframe](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/04_wire_wireframe.png) | ![Shaded](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/03_wire_shaded.png) |\n| **Display menu** | ![Menu closed](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/23_display_menu_closed.png) | ![Menu open](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/24_display_menu_open.png) |\n| **Toolpaths** | ![Toolpaths off](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/05_paths_off.png) | ![Toolpaths on](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/06_paths_on.png) |\n| **World axes** | ![Axes off](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/07_axes_off.png) | ![Axes on](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/08_axes_on.png) |\n| **Pick through** | ![Pick through off](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/09_pick_through_off.png) | ![Pick through on](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/10_pick_through_on.png) |\n| **Move handles** | ![Move off](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/11_move_mode_off.png) | ![Move on](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/12_move_mode_on.png) |\n| **Rotate rings** | ![Rotate off](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/13_rotate_mode_off.png) | ![Rotate on](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/14_rotate_mode_on.png) |\n| **Projection** | ![Orthographic](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/16_projection_ortho.png) | ![Perspective](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/15_projection_perspective.png) |\n\n### Nav Drag Tools (Unlatched vs Latched Active)\n| Nav Tool | Unlatched Tooltip | Latched Active Tooltip |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Orbit** | ![Orbit unlatched](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/17_orbit_latched_off.png) | ![Orbit latched](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/18_orbit_latched_on.png) |\n| **Pan** | ![Pan unlatched](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/19_pan_latched_off.png) | ![Pan latched](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/20_pan_latched_on.png) |\n| **Zoom** | ![Zoom unlatched](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/21_zoom_latched_off.png) | ![Zoom latched](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JSwetz/Camcraft/evidence/2914/22_zoom_latched_on.png) |\n\n## Readings and Pinning Tests\n\n- `egui_app::viewport_bar::tests::tooltip_tests::nav_buttons_have_distinct_labels_and_descriptive_tooltips`: asserts each control has a non-empty label and tooltip, and that state changes reflect in the tooltip output.\n- `egui_app::viewport_bar::tests::tooltip_tests::nav_buttons_attach_tooltips_on_hover`: asserts all controls expose matching accessibility nodes and paint their hover tooltips when hovered in an egui harness.\n- `egui_app::viewport_bar::tests::tooltip_tests::generate_evidence_screenshots`: renders deterministic visual evidence screenshots for all controls and toggle states.\n- Verified all viewport bar tests pass (`cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib viewport_bar`).\n- Verified clean `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`.\n- Verified clean `coderabbit review --agent --base upstream/main` (0 findings).\n\n## What was not exercised\n\n- Full GPU hardware rendering pipeline (covered by GPU test suites in CI).\n\nChangelog: UI: add hover tooltips and accessibility labels to the main viewport controls\n\nFixes #2914\n",
